  displayName: The Broken Meridian
  subtitle: A mixed threshold where timelines scrape against the same door.
  biomeTags: 00000000010000000b000000
  paletteHint: cold slate, bruised green, dead-gold seams
  lightingHint: thin dawn light cutting through black dust
  materialNotes: fractured stone, mismatched eras, memory-glass edges
  prologueLine: The Hollow Star has folded a thousand first steps into one room.
  branchLine: Branches stitch old minutes to new wounds.
  hubLine: The memory anchor holds, but it does not forgive weight.
  bossLine: The warden remembers a road that no longer exists.
  extractionLine: You slip from one collapse, not from the Star.
